# ------------------------------------------------------------------- local toolchain
# A JDK and a Gradle distribution downloaded for this machine only. Nobody cloning the
# repo needs them: the Gradle wrapper fetches its own distribution, and the toolchain
# resolver picks up a JDK 21 from the machine or downloads one. See README.
.tools/

# ----------------------------------------------------------- local delivery staging
# Where the built jar is copied before being dropped into a mods folder. Release builds
# belong on the GitHub Releases page, not in the tree.
outputs/

